From b2411328437bea8471c29e78d3c8346fb5856b1a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: gugu-acp <gugu-acp@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 16:18:02 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] gugu: ship the ACP server without the terminal UI (drop
 zcode-acp-martty)

`zcode-acp-martty` (the bridge's own terminal UI, used only by
`zcode-acp tui`) is a regular dependency, and installing it pulls in a large
native/wasm tree: @deepseek-ai/libreoffice-kit (146 MB wasm), sherpa-onnx
(32 MB per platform), resvg, @openma/deepseek-harness-acp and more - about
190 MB that the ACP server never loads. src/tui.ts already resolves Martty
lazily and handles its absence; the dependency is removed, the "not
installed" error now says this build has no terminal UI, and the tui test
pins that.

Why: Gugu ships this bridge inside its app and its server package and only
runs the ACP server (dist/cli.js with no arguments).

Upstream: not filed - owner 10-17: kept and maintained here only (see
bridges/zcode-acp/PATCHES.md for the upstream code it touches).

Drop when: never while Gugu only needs the ACP server; re-check on upgrade
that nothing outside src/tui.ts imports zcode-acp-martty.
